This seems to be fixed after https://github.com/parcel-bundler/parcel/pull/4861:
```ts
// a.ts
import { foo } from "./b";
console.log(foo);

// b.ts
import { Token } from "./c";
export { Token };
export const foo = 1;

// c.ts
export type Token = {
	type: number;
};
```
